      "updated": 1792287961853,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• STT: Dual-Engine Whisper (Tiny estrito + Small 12-thr)\n• NLU: Scikit-Learn TF-IDF + Hard Rules determinísticas\n• LLM Router Flexível:\n  - Local: Ollama (Qwen, Llama, Phi)\n  - Nuvem (Out-of-the-box): Gemini API / OpenAI\n• TTS: Piper ONNX ultrarrápido (Voz neural Faber)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• STT: Dual-Engine Whisper (Tiny estrito + Small 12-thr)\n• NLU: Scikit-Learn TF-IDF + Hard Rules determinísticas\n• LLM Router Flexível:\n  - Local: Ollama (Qwen, Llama, Phi)\n  - Nuvem (Out-of-the-box): Gemini API / OpenAI\n• TTS: Piper ONNX ultrarrápido (Voz neural Faber)"
    },
